```
Initialize Dynamics → Inject Faults → Propagate Orbits
                   ↓
          ML Fault Detection (Real-Time)
                   ↓
         DRL Decision Making (Real-Time)
                   ↓
           Task Reassignment
                   ↓
            Record Telemetry
                   ↓
      Generate Visualization Data
```

