```
Generate Plots → Export Data → Create Vizard Binary
             ↓
    ML Detection Summary
             ↓
    DRL Decision Analysis (DRL Tab)
             ↓
 Cluster Formation Metrics
             ↓
  Analyze Fault Impact
```

