## Output Files

### Log Files

**Location**: `logs/sim_results_YYYYMMDD_HHMMSS/`

- `simulation_summary.txt`: Configuration and results overview
- `telemetry_*.csv`: Time-series spacecraft data
- `fault_log.txt`: Fault injection timeline
- `ml_detection_results.json`: ML detection summary
- `drl_decisions.json`: Task reassignment log
- `cluster_status.json`: Formation health metrics
- `drl_performance.json`: DRL agent performance metrics

### Plot Files

**Location**: `plots/`

- `*_ConstellationAnalysis.png`: Orbital configuration
- `*_ClusterFormation.png`: Formation geometry
- `*_ClusterCommunication.png`: Communication dashboard
- `*_FaultAnalysis.png`: Fault impact visualization
- `*_InterSatelliteDistances.png`: Formation geometry
- `*_PowerAnalysis.png`: Power system performance
- `*_MLDetectionSummary.png`: Detection results
- `*_DRLDecisionAnalysis.png`: Reassignment visualization
- `task_progress.png`: Task completion heatmap
- `battery.png`: Battery status visualization
- `remaining_tasks_heatmap.png`: Remaining task distribution

### Vizard Files

**Location**: `Vizfile/_VizFiles/`

- `*_UnityViz.bin`: 3D visualization binary (compressed 30-min → 30-sec playback)
- Compatible with Basilisk Vizard application
- Enhanced cluster visualization with color coding

### ML/DRL Model Files

**Location**: `core/`

- `anomaly_detection_model.keras`: Fault detection model
- `drl_task_reassignment.h5`: Task reassignment model
- `scaler_data.pkl`: Feature normalization parameters

